  "conclusion": "`.WordCount` is whitespace-based and diverges for CJK (each Han/Kana/Hangul character counts as one word in Jekyll). The ported partial (findRE \\p{Han}\\p{Katakana}\\p{Hiragana}\\p{Hangul}) matches Jekyll on every case. Read time must use the partial, never .WordCount.",
